---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { supabaseUrl } from "../lib/supabase-public";
const termsPreview = `${supabaseUrl}/storage/v1/object/public/materuni-images/waterfall_image/1791601414950-ew7ak42gjka.jpg`;
---
<SiteLayout title="Booking Terms | Materuni Hosts" description="Important booking, payment and practical information for Materuni Hosts experiences." preloadImage={termsPreview}>
<section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BOOK</span><h1>Simple, clear booking terms.</h1><p>What to expect when planning a Materuni experience with a local host.</p></section>
<section class="section legal-copy">
  <h2>Booking requests</h2>
  <p>Submitting a booking form sends a request. It does not create a confirmed reservation. Your local host will review the requested experience, date, group size and availability, then contact you to confirm the arrangements.</p>
  <h2>Prices</h2>
  <p>Published experience prices are shown in US dollars and are per person. The total depends on the selected experience and number of guests. Your host will confirm the final details before the booking is accepted.</p>
  <h2>Transport and pickup</h2>
  <p>Pickup and transport arrangements must be discussed and confirmed separately. Please provide your hotel or preferred pickup point when you enquire. Do not assume transport is included unless your host has confirmed it in writing.</p>
  <h2>Payment</h2>
  <p>There is no live card payment on this website at present. After your host confirms the booking details, you will receive the applicable payment instructions. Do not send payment to an account that has not been confirmed by Materuni Hosts.</p>
  <h2>Experience conditions and safety</h2>
  <p>Some experiences include walking on uneven, wet or steep natural paths. Wear suitable footwear and follow your guide’s instructions. Waterfall and swimming conditions can change; swimming is only appropriate when local conditions and your guide permit it. Tell us in advance about mobility, health, dietary or other practical requirements so we can discuss what is suitable.</p>
  <h2>Weather and trail conditions</h2>
  <p>Rain, trail conditions and water levels can affect the waterfall walk and other outdoor activities. For safety, your guide may recommend adjusting the route, changing the activity or rescheduling. Before you accept a change, your host will explain the available options and any difference in price. No alternative activity should be treated as agreed until you have accepted it.</p>
  <h2>Deposits and payment timing</h2>
  <p>Submitting an enquiry does not require a deposit or payment. If a deposit is required for your confirmed booking, your host will state the amount, due date, payment method and refund conditions in writing with the final quote. Do not pay until you have reviewed those terms and received written booking confirmation.</p>
  <h2>Children and young guests</h2>
  <p>Please include the ages of any children in your enquiry. A responsible adult must accompany guests under 18. The waterfall trail, uneven ground, weather and overnight camping arrangements may not suit every age; your host will discuss suitability and any practical limits before accepting the booking.</p>
  <h2>Changes and cancellations</h2>
  <p>If you need to change or cancel a confirmed booking, contact your host as soon as possible and include your booking reference. Changes are subject to availability and any applicable costs will be explained before you agree to them. The cancellation deadlines, refund arrangements and any weather-related rescheduling or refund terms that apply to your booking must be provided to you in writing before you make payment. Please ask your host for these terms if they have not yet been shared.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For booking questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@materunihosts.com">hello@materunihosts.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/255612068540">+255 612 068 540</a>.</p>
  <p class="muted legal-updated">Last updated: 15 October 2026.</p>
</section>
</SiteLayout>
